<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Buenos Aires Embotelladora and Huntingdon Life.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Buenos Aires Embotelladora and Huntingdon Life.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday that Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA and Huntingdon Life were unavailable.</p>
<p>Those unavailable for news were: John Alden Financial Corp, America Online Inc, Electronic Data Systems Corp, Cedar Fair LP, Mead Corp, Commscope Inc, Heritage Media Corp and Johnston Industries Inc.</p>
